-- OSDU Delivery: the database users its apps (and the people sql_admins names) sign in as, under Entra authentication
-- (each app as its own managed identity, no password anywhere), on a server this configuration does not administer.
-- Run as an Entra administrator of ${server}, connected to each database below in turn (Azure SQL Database does not
-- switch databases with USE); every statement can run again. Until they have run, the control plane reports its first
-- start-up step as failed and retries it, and a worker cannot start.
%{ for database in databases ~}

-- ${database.name}: ${database.purpose}
%{ for user in database.users ~}
IF USER_ID(N'${replace(user.name, "'", "''")}') IS NULL CREATE USER [${replace(user.name, "]", "]]")}] FROM EXTERNAL PROVIDER;
%{ endfor ~}
%{ for statement in database.statements ~}
${statement}
%{ endfor ~}
%{ endfor ~}
